{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkxnzPVTLoTQW9juEf8D","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Honestly? I'm dropping my iShares one. What I'd actually do is what the page marks as \"הזול ★\": ילין לפידות מחקה S&P 500 (4D) through a פסגות account, which ends at 86,492 ₪. I'm fairly sure, but not totally. What decided it was a red bar near the bottom. My fund, \"iShares S&P 500 Swap UCITS ETF USD (Acc)\", sits under \"קרן שנקנית בחו״ל\" with a little lock, at 59,196 ₪ and \"פחות 19,980 ₪\". That's almost 20k less, while everything else is around 77–86k. A 0.05% fee sounded like nothing, but 20k in shekels is serious.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Top of the page:** the heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\" looked right, and S&P 500 was already picked. The sliders were set to 10,000 ₪ today, 500 a month, 10 years and 7%. That isn't my 30,000, but I didn't touch them. The first big number was 86,492 ₪ in the box marked \"הבחירה שלכם · ★ הזול\", next to \"הזוג הבא בתור\" at 86,449, so it's almost the same.\n- **The fund list (left):** my fund was there with \"דמי ניהול שנתיים: 0.05%\", but on the left it says \"אין מחיר כאן\" and \"עוד לא נאסף\". So at this point there's no number for it at all, and I didn't get why.\n- **The account list (right):** I scrolled through it. פסגות is first and cheapest. I trust the names לאומי and הפועלים, but they cost a bit more. Under them I saw red bars for אלטשולר, אקסלנס and מיטב.\n- **Skipped:** the text block \"מה כתוב בפרסום, מול התעריפון\", the \"what if\" chart with the 20% buttons, and the whole hedged vs unhedged section with charts and tables. I didn't read any of them.\n- **Near the bottom:** a section titled \"מתחילים מבחירה אחת…\". That's where my fund showed up in red, 59,196 ₪.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- Further up the page says my fund has no price, then down here it has a number. I'm not sure which one is true. Maybe that's what the lock means (\"נשען על כלל מס פתוח: מוצג ולא מדורג\"), but I don't really get it.\n- Small chips that meant nothing to me: \"צוברת\", \"נקנית בחו״ל\", \"חשיפה לדולר\", \"מס רק במכירה\", \"נאמן\", \"עמלות קנייה ומכירה\", \"דמי משמרת\", \"W-8BEN\".\n- There's no \"how do I start\" button.\n- The page is very long and full of numbers. I'd have closed it on the bus around the hedging charts."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4954,"cache_read_input_tokens":18528,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4954},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f291dbff-c161-4a39-a015-353aee79f86d","uuid":"5a70d2dd-e33b-4d6e-b744-eefa80f71846","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:27:19.738Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkxnz2u1F1r6Cxri1Pnz"}
